    "title": "Digital Car Key",
    "description": "Digital Car Key application gives you full control of your vehicle is now available on Google Play.\r\nThe car key improves the intelligent control and security of your car.\r\n\r\nThe Best Universal Car Remote App - Check Your Car Status, Share Car Access, Locate Vehicle, Navigate and More with Smart Car Key Connected\r\n\r\nYou just need to make sure your vehicle is compatible with this app. Smart Car Key Remote is compatible with more than 20 car brands: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Ram Trucks, Tesla, Toyota and Volkswagen. The configuration details will be displayed step by step in the application.\r\n\r\nImportant Features:\r\n\r\n- WIRELESS LOCKING & UNLOCKING of car door\r\n- KeyConnect supports over 20 car brands\r\n- SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your car",
